GIVEN `the answers for the routes of paragraphs (1)(a) to (1)(d), (2), (3), (5), (7A), (7C)(a), (7C)(b), (7D), (7E) and (8)(za) to (8)(b)` IS A LIST OF MAYBE BOOLEAN
